<h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>Is the Gemini app available for Windows?</h3><p>Yes. Google says the Gemini app for Windows launched on September 10, 2026 and is available globally for Windows 10 and 11.</p><h3>What shortcut opens Gemini on Windows?</h3><p>Google says you can press Alt + Space to open Gemini over your active work.</p><h3>Can Gemini work with Google apps?</h3><p>Google says Gemini can pull information from supported Google apps such as Gmail and Drive for certain workflows.</p>
